.* .mg /code/message/ (LR p.246)
.mg //Your terminal is on.
.mg /W/Your terminal is smoking.
.mg /1e/Your terminal is on fire.
.mg /I
.mg //
.mg
.* .dm name(n) /line/ (LR p.142): n from 0, one final delimiter dropped
.ms on
.dm sub(10) /second/
.dm sub(0) /first/
.dm sub(20) /a/b/
.dm sub(30)
.sub
.* .dm name alone: a null macro
.dm null
.null
after the null macro
.* .and is .an (LR p.66)
.if 1 eq 1
.and 2 eq 2 and: both true
.* m is mh on a vertical operand too (LR p.58)
.sp 2m
